tion Software](https://www.softclinicsoftware.com/laboratory-information-system-lis/)\\n* Pharmacy Software\\n  \\n    + [Pharmacy Management System](https://www.softclinicsoftware.com/pharmacy-management-system/)\\n* Hospital Software\\n  \\n    + [Hospital Information Management System](https://www.softclinicsoftware.com/hospital-information-system-his/)\\n    + [Electronic Medical Records](https://www.softclinicsoftware.\\ncom/electronic-health-records/)\\n    + [Schedule Demo](https://www.softclinicsoftware.com/software-schedule-demo/)\\n  \\n    + Clinic Software\\n    + Laboratory Software\\n    + Pharmacy Software\\n*\\n\\n* SoftClinic-GenX-digital-healthTech-Platform\\n\\n* SoftClinicGenX-digital-healthtech-platform\\n\\n# Clinic and Hospital Management Software\\n\\n“SoftClinic GenX is an end-to-end hospital management software that helps physicians, clinics, and hospitals to make their practice paperless. We tailor customized hospital information management systems and clinic information management system that best suits the unique requirement of each hospital. SoftClinic GenX hospital software comes with different modules like Laboratory, Pharmacy, HR, Inventory, and Accounting; thereby digitizing the basic management and record-keeping and making management tasks easier.\\nSoftClinic GenX has made global marks in a very short span of time and is currently being used in 45 countries by more than 25,000 physicians across all verticals of the healthcare industry.”\\n\\n## Industry Accolades. SoftClinic GenX On The Podium\\n\\n[](https://www.goodfirms.co/hospital-management-software/)\\n\\nMake your Practice Paperless with SoftClinic GenX EHR & HIS\\n\\nThis is the most comprehensive hospital or clinic software for physicians to help them run their practice with ease for many years.\\n\\nEHR\\n\\n# [EHR Software](https://www.softclinicsoftware.com/electronic-health-records/)\\n\\nElectronic Health Record (EHR) software helps physicians to digitize patients’ 